{"ep": "26", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:12.79", "end": "0:00:16.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "脑子里面一整年都在失控的导演兼制作人所指挥的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:16.98", "end": "0:00:19.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这部少根筋的超现实写实主义电影"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:19.39", "end": "0:00:22.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在熬了一整夜完成编辑工作之后"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:22.36", "end": "0:00:24.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们SOS团的每一个人"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:24.22", "end": "0:00:26.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都终于迎来了文化祭平安的第一天"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:27.33", "end": "0:00:28.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "幸运的是"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:28.52", "end": "0:00:30.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诸如细节交涉和宣传活动之类的事务"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:30.84", "end": "0:00:32.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日都会身先士卒地亲自出动"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:33.25", "end": "0:00:37.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我把制作好的DVD交给接受委托播放影片的电影研究会之后"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:37.79", "end": "0:00:40.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "带着明镜止水般的心情一面环游校园"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:41.01", "end": "0:00:43.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一面用睡眠不足的脑袋享受着祭典的气氛"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:45.73", "end": "0:00:46.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说如此"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:46.84", "end": "0:00:49.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我还是有一个决不能错过的重要使命"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 13, "start": "0:02:21.61", "end": "0:02:25.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和用什么校内调查问卷这种毫无活力的活动\n来随便应付一下的我们班不同"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 14, "start": "0:02:25.79", "end": "0:02:30.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  古泉和朝比奈学姐他们\n都在认真地在班上的活动中工作"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 15, "start": "0:02:25.88", "end": "0:02:28.26", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（新作游戏）（请自由地尝试）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 16, "start": "0:02:30.68", "end": "0:02:31.91", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（1-6  占卜小屋  我会全都说出来哦！）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 17, "start": "0:02:32.00", "end": "0:02:35.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你会在5分15秒之后购买雪糕"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 18, "start": "0:02:35.42", "end": "0:02:38.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "5分28秒后把它掉到脚上面"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 19, "start": "0:02:38.12", "end": "0:02:40.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "7分6秒后脑袋撞在招牌上"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 20, "start": "0:02:40.83", "end": "0:02:43.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那时你会撞到你的女朋友"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:43.10", "end": "0:02:45.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她包里放的东西会掉出来散落在地上"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 22, "start": "0:02:45.59", "end": "0:02:46.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "7分11秒后…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 23, "start": "0:02:46.12", "end": "0:02:46.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门啊…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 24, "start": "0:02:47.00", "end": "0:02:48.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还是适可而止吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 25, "start": "0:02:48.33", "end": "0:02:49.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "占卜和预言可是不同的哦"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 26, "start": "0:02:50.00", "end": "0:02:52.42", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（君臣人子小命呜呼）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 27, "start": "0:02:52.58", "end": "0:02:53.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么这个世界"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 28, "start": "0:02:53.98", "end": "0:02:57.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是自然世界是被概率所支配的世界"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 29, "start": "0:02:57.75", "end": "0:02:58.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然如此"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 30, "start": "0:02:58.89", "end": "0:03:02.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是很难说现在在这里概率论是成立的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:02.55", "end": "0:03:05.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我们这样考虑比较妥当吧："}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:05.62", "end": "0:03:07.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在我们已经脱离了自然"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:08.26", "end": "0:03:10.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "进入了超自然的领域"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:11.10", "end": "0:03:13.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们假设这里有六只老鼠…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:13.40", "end": "0:03:14.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是啥啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:14.40", "end": "0:03:16.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一面演一面说明下哪里是笑点吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:20.48", "end": "0:03:21.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗨"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:21.75", "end": "0:03:22.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有收获么？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:23.45", "end": "0:03:24.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有期待中的那么好呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:25.17", "end": "0:03:27.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "桌球社的乒乓雪糕还算好吃吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:27.83", "end": "0:03:29.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "3年3班的关东煮也不错呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 42, "start": "0:03:29.80", "end": "0:03:33.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "2年5班是巧克力香蕉  他们巧克力加得很吝啬啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 43, "start": "0:03:33.69", "end": "0:03:35.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么嘛  你们只是到处吃东西而已吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 44, "start": "0:03:35.68", "end": "0:03:36.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天很有食欲呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 45, "start": "0:03:37.24", "end": "0:03:40.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  那么我们就去今天真正的目的地——Cosplay咖啡厅吧！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 46, "start": "0:03:41.09", "end": "0:03:43.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说前阵子的兔女郎装也很令人惊叹"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 47, "start": "0:03:43.55", "end": "0:03:45.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次又会是什么服装呢？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 48, "start": "0:03:46.09", "end": "0:03:47.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过话说回来"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 49, "start": "0:03:47.32", "end": "0:03:50.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说是去演电影  结果害我在池塘里玩潜水"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 50, "start": "0:03:50.72", "end": "0:03:53.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "做落汤鸡的赔礼就只有这一张7折炒面券吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 51, "start": "0:03:53.82", "end": "0:03:55.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是不划算啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 52, "start": "0:03:55.23", "end": "0:03:57.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不爽就别去  快给我滚吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 53, "start": "0:03:57.40", "end": "0:04:01.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过呢～朝比奈学姐Cosplay的样子\n还是一定要好好看上一看的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:01.87", "end": "0:04:05.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会是像拍电影时的那种很有跃动感的迷你裙女服务生装吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:05.93", "end": "0:04:08.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你和春日到底把朝比奈学姐当成什么了？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:08.75", "end": "0:04:11.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "班上同学一起制作的女服务生装么…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 57, "start": "0:04:11.69", "end": "0:04:12.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真期待啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 58, "start": "0:04:12.89", "end": "0:04:13.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了好了～"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 59, "start": "0:04:13.65", "end": "0:04:14.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  谢谢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 60, "start": "0:04:14.85", "end": "0:04:18.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀！阿虚和他的朋友们这边这边～！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 61, "start": "0:04:18.73", "end": "0:04:21.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢迎！欢迎三位光临本店～"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 62, "start": "0:04:22.00", "end": "0:04:25.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这件衣服如何？我穿起来是不是可爱到爆啊？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 63, "start": "0:04:26.18", "end": "0:04:27.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么样捏？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 64, "start": "0:04:27.46", "end": "0:04:28.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那当然"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 65, "start": "0:04:28.73", "end": "0:04:29.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "生意真好啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 66, "start": "0:04:30.67", "end": "0:04:31.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "客人一个接一个地都上钩了！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 67, "start": "0:04:32.06", "end": "0:04:34.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明是便宜材料做出来的不怎么样的炒面"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 68, "start": "0:04:34.73", "end": "0:04:37.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "竟然来了这么多客人  真是赚翻了！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 69, "start": "0:04:37.66", "end": "0:04:39.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我都笑得合不上嘴啦！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 70, "start": "0:04:39.35", "end": "0:04:43.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这个世界上的男性都这么容易受骗呢？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 71, "start": "0:04:43.30", "end": "0:04:44.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  那边是队尾"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 72, "start": "0:04:44.99", "end": "0:04:46.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去排队啦去排队啦！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 73, "start": "0:04:47.26", "end": "0:04:48.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "麻烦你们先付钱了～"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 74, "start": "0:04:49.28", "end": "0:04:52.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外菜单上只有炒面和水哦"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 75, "start": "0:04:52.42", "end": "0:04:56.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "炒面一份300日元  自来水不要钱随便喝！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 76, "start": "0:04:52.42", "end": "0:04:56.16", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（这里是指可饮用的自来水）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 77, "start": "0:04:56.68", "end": "0:04:57.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  给你这个"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 78, "start": "0:04:57.94", "end": "0:04:59.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  三个人是吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 79, "start": "0:05:00.02", "end": "0:05:03.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么所有人一共…500日元就好了  大优惠！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 80, "start": "0:05:06.93", "end": "0:05:08.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么稍等一小小会儿"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 81, "start": "0:05:09.16", "end": "0:05:10.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "马上就轮到你们了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 82, "start": "0:05:12.48", "end": "0:05:13.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是有精神啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 83, "start": "0:05:14.38", "end": "0:05:16.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她也是你和凉宫那一伙人的成员吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 84, "start": "0:05:16.90", "end": "0:05:17.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 85, "start": "0:05:18.40", "end": "0:05:20.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "话说回来  找钱要分给我们啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 86, "start": "0:05:20.60", "end": "0:05:21.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "眼真尖！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 87, "start": "0:05:22.07", "end": "0:05:26.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "鹤屋学姐说的「一小小会儿」大约是30分钟左右"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 88, "start": "0:05:23.66", "end": "0:05:24.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请请请请"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 89, "start": "0:05:26.16", "end": "0:05:29.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们等了很长时间后终于进了店里"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 90, "start": "0:05:26.17", "end": "0:05:29.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂！这里来3杯水！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 91, "start": "0:05:29.52", "end": "0:05:30.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的～"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 92, "start": "0:05:32.63", "end": "0:05:34.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢迎光临～"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 93, "start": "0:05:34.30", "end": "0:05:36.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来啦——！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 94, "start": "0:05:34.63", "end": "0:05:38.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "连百万美元的夜景也会自愧不如的\n美不胜收的最萌女服务生登场了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 95, "start": "0:05:39.09", "end": "0:05:41.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与在社团活动室看到她的时候不同  身上闪耀着另一种光辉"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 96, "start": "0:05:42.06", "end": "0:05:44.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "欢迎各位光临本店"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 97, "start": "0:05:47.81", "end": "0:05:48.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 98, "start": "0:05:48.63", "end": "0:05:49.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是谷口！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 99, "start": "0:05:48.63", "end": "0:05:49.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是国木田！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 100, "start": "0:05:50.72", "end": "0:05:52.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拍电影的时候受两位关照了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 101, "start": "0:05:52.73", "end": "0:05:56.34", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（请勿拍照）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 102, "start": "0:05:52.73", "end": "0:05:56.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "做得很对  如果允许拍照的话会恐怕马上就会陷入混乱状态吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 103, "start": "0:05:56.86", "end": "0:05:59.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是件好到想要颁发最佳设计奖给它的衣服"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 104, "start": "0:06:00.06", "end": "0:06:04.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还是由足以登上青少年时尚杂志封面的那两人穿着"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 105, "start": "0:06:03.27", "end": "0:06:04.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请稍等一下"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 106, "start": "0:06:04.44", "end": "0:06:05.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "简直可以说是壮丽到极点了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 107, "start": "0:06:07.11", "end": "0:06:09.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠负责给食券剪票"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 108, "start": "0:06:09.54", "end": "0:06:11.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有就是收拾桌子和倒水了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 109, "start": "0:06:12.18", "end": "0:06:15.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果让她端炒面总觉得会绊倒呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 110, "start": "0:06:15.87", "end": "0:06:17.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不愧是学姐  果然明白得很透彻"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 111, "start": "0:06:18.46", "end": "0:06:21.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "结果由于店内客人流动速度实在太快了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 112, "start": "0:06:21.71", "end": "0:06:24.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因此我们用了5分钟左右把炒面一扫而空之后"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 113, "start": "0:06:23.93", "end": "0:06:24.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 114, "start": "0:06:24.50", "end": "0:06:26.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "便带着完全不满足的感觉离开了小店"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 115, "start": "0:06:27.12", "end": "0:06:28.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来要去做什么？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 116, "start": "0:06:28.34", "end": "0:06:30.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想要去看看阿虚他们拍的电影呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 117, "start": "0:06:30.73", "end": "0:06:33.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也想顺便确认一下自己被拍成什么样子了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 118, "start": "0:06:33.23", "end": "0:06:35.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种东西我才懒得看"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 119, "start": "0:06:35.26", "end": "0:06:36.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我也是一样的感觉"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 120, "start": "0:06:36.77", "end": "0:06:38.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是从你嘴里说出来倒是很令我不爽"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 121, "start": "0:06:38.87", "end": "0:06:40.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "光吃那点炒面完全不够啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 122, "start": "0:06:41.30", "end": "0:06:43.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来去科学社的烤肉派对吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 123, "start": "0:06:44.04", "end": "0:06:45.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还要吃啊？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 124, "start": "0:06:45.62", "end": "0:06:47.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过在那之前…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 125, "start": "0:06:48.49", "end": "0:06:49.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们去搭讪吧！搭讪！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 126, "start": "0:06:50.06", "end": "0:06:50.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搭讪？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 127, "start": "0:06:50.94", "end": "0:06:52.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "瞄准那些穿便服的女生就好了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 128, "start": "0:06:53.00", "end": "0:06:55.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去和三个人左右一组行动的女生打招呼"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 129, "start": "0:06:55.57", "end": "0:06:57.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然有些不可思议  但经常就会乖乖地跟过来了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 130, "start": "0:06:58.35", "end": "0:07:00.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是从我的经验中总结出来的法则"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 131, "start": "0:07:00.92", "end": "0:07:04.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "成功率几乎是零的经验之谈能有什么用啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 132, "start": "0:07:04.67", "end": "0:07:07.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就算了  你们两个去吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 133, "start": "0:07:07.32", "end": "0:07:08.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我也不要了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 134, "start": "0:07:08.79", "end": "0:07:12.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你自己去吧  如果成功了就介绍对方的朋友给我好了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 135, "start": "0:07:12.78", "end": "0:07:14.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂…你们搞什么啊！真是没毅力！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 136, "start": "0:07:15.06", "end": "0:07:16.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是毅力的问题"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 137, "start": "0:07:16.92", "end": "0:07:22.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "万一在搭讪时被谁看见的话…这个…嗯…总之就怕万一嘛"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 138, "start": "0:07:23.10", "end": "0:07:25.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  尽情享受文化祭吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 139, "start": "0:07:26.00", "end": "0:07:26.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「普普通通」地享受吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 140, "start": "0:07:31.67", "end": "0:07:36.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我！给我！给——我——啦！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 141, "start": "0:07:32.38", "end": "0:07:35.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么…去哪里呢？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 142, "start": "0:07:36.22", "end": "0:07:40.14", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（套圈  或是套住人生呢？）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 143, "start": "0:07:40.65", "end": "0:07:43.61", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（猜谜·亿万富翁）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 144, "start": "0:07:48.80", "end": "0:07:51.74", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（关东煮  饮料  冰凉～的饮料  茶  可口可乐）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 145, "start": "0:07:48.80", "end": "0:07:49.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你看见刚才那个了么？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 146, "start": "0:07:49.91", "end": "0:07:51.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看见了看见了  真有趣呢！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 147, "start": "0:07:55.70", "end": "0:07:57.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大讲堂是吹奏乐社的音乐会"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 148, "start": "0:07:58.08", "end": "0:08:00.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后是轻音乐社和非社团成员组织的乐队吗"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 149, "start": "0:08:01.42", "end": "0:08:06.83", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（空瓶放于此处）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 150, "start": "0:08:01.42", "end": "0:08:03.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来可以一直坐着呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 151, "start": "0:08:03.72", "end": "0:08:06.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该足够休息一下熬了一整夜的身体吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 152, "start": "0:08:50.72", "end": "0:08:53.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这样  我们是BANDAG！Thank you！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 153, "start": "0:08:59.20", "end": "0:09:02.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来是轻音乐部ENOZ的表演"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 154, "start": "0:09:21.54", "end": "0:09:23.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那  那是在搞啥？！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 155, "start": "0:09:31.86", "end": "0:09:33.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙在做什么啊！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 156, "start": "0:12:54.71", "end": "0:12:56.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学真棒啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 157, "start": "0:12:57.15", "end": "0:12:58.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门同学也是"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 158, "start": "0:12:58.57", "end": "0:12:59.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这是什么打扮啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 159, "start": "0:13:00.18", "end": "0:13:01.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是匆忙赶来的嘛"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 160, "start": "0:13:02.40", "end": "0:13:04.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我从学生会那里听到了传闻"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 161, "start": "0:13:04.80", "end": "0:13:07.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说凉宫同学好像在大讲堂又有了什么惊人之举"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 162, "start": "0:13:08.74", "end": "0:13:09.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是指这个吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 163, "start": "0:13:10.11", "end": "0:13:10.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 164, "start": "0:13:10.89", "end": "0:13:11.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…各位…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 165, "start": "0:13:12.68", "end": "0:13:14.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  我们是ENOZ"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 166, "start": "0:13:14.73", "end": "0:13:16.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本来应该是由乐队成员的姓氏"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 167, "start": "0:13:16.31", "end": "0:13:18.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「榎本」「中西」「冈岛」「财前」"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 168, "start": "0:13:16.31", "end": "0:13:18.61", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（日文罗马字拼写分别为\n「Enomoto」「Nakanishi」「Okajima」「Zaizen」）"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 169, "start": "0:13:18.80", "end": "0:13:21.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "取首字母组成「ENOZ」这个名字的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 170, "start": "0:13:22.07", "end": "0:13:23.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是很遗憾  因为有些不可抗拒的原因"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 171, "start": "0:13:23.77", "end": "0:13:27.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天榎本同学和中西同学没有办法登上这个舞台"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 172, "start": "0:13:27.62", "end": "0:13:30.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和那边的有希是代演  并不是真正的乐队成员"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 173, "start": "0:13:31.15", "end": "0:13:31.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对不起！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 174, "start": "0:13:33.10", "end": "0:13:35.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么从正式成员开始介绍"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 175, "start": "0:13:36.09", "end": "0:13:37.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "鼓手瑞树！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 176, "start": "0:13:41.79", "end": "0:13:43.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来是贝司手舞！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 177, "start": "0:13:48.51", "end": "0:13:51.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后是临时成员  吉他手有希"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 178, "start": "0:13:52.78", "end": "0:13:54.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最后临时主唱是我"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 179, "start": "0:13:55.26", "end": "0:13:57.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不但吉他几乎只是端着而已"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 180, "start": "0:13:57.72", "end": "0:14:00.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "连唱歌也没有自信可以胜任代演"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 181, "start": "0:14:00.81", "end": "0:14:04.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为第一次看到乐谱到上台不过只有1小时而已"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 182, "start": "0:14:04.58", "end": "0:14:05.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的是临阵磨枪"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 183, "start": "0:14:08.15", "end": "0:14:10.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对了  如果有人想听到不是代演"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 184, "start": "0:14:10.58", "end": "0:14:14.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而是真正的吉他手和主唱表演的真正的这几首曲目"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 185, "start": "0:14:14.38", "end": "0:14:15.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请一会儿来找我们"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 186, "start": "0:14:15.86", "end": "0:14:20.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  如果有MD之类的话  我们可以免费录给他吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 187, "start": "0:14:21.20", "end": "0:14:21.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么样？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 188, "start": "0:14:22.78", "end": "0:14:24.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  那就这么决定了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 189, "start": "0:14:26.85", "end": "0:14:28.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么另一首歌"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 190, "start": "0:14:28.45", "end": "0:14:30.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于时间不够  只准备了两首"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 191, "start": "0:14:31.05", "end": "0:14:32.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以这就是最后一首了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 192, "start": "0:14:32.86", "end": "0:14:34.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然可能有些无法满足大家"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 193, "start": "0:14:34.64", "end": "0:14:36.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我们会尽力表演的  请听吧！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 194, "start": "0:14:37.14", "end": "0:14:38.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么开始了！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 195, "start": "0:14:38.35", "end": "0:14:39.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Lost My Music!"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 196, "start": "0:16:01.38", "end": "0:16:03.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后来我去问了她原因"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 197, "start": "0:16:03.71", "end": "0:16:05.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我在校门口发电影传单"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 198, "start": "0:16:05.74", "end": "0:16:08.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "发完之后本来想直接回社团活动室的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 199, "start": "0:16:08.53", "end": "0:16:15.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "结果就在鞋柜那里看到北高祭执行委员\n和那个乐队的人为了是否登台演出而争执"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 200, "start": "0:16:16.32", "end": "0:16:20.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "主唱榎本同学在正式登场的前一天因为扁桃腺发炎而住院"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 201, "start": "0:16:20.26", "end": "0:16:24.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而吉他手中西同学则是当天在学校绊倒而扭伤了手腕"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 202, "start": "0:16:24.19", "end": "0:16:26.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两个人都已经不可能上场表演了呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 203, "start": "0:16:26.85", "end": "0:16:28.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "中西同学是三年级生"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 204, "start": "0:16:28.55", "end": "0:16:31.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于是最后一次参加北高祭  一副拼死也要上场的样子"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 205, "start": "0:16:31.54", "end": "0:16:32.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "歌也是原创的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 206, "start": "0:16:33.34", "end": "0:16:37.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但中西同学最后还是被带走检查手腕…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 207, "start": "0:16:37.98", "end": "0:16:40.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以你就一撸袖子冲上去了吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 208, "start": "0:16:41.01", "end": "0:16:42.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那倒不是"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 209, "start": "0:16:43.06", "end": "0:16:44.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  如果是我的话"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 210, "start": "0:16:44.33", "end": "0:16:46.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算是嗓子毁掉或者手断掉"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 211, "start": "0:16:46.47", "end": "0:16:48.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也会用凭着一股干劲硬撑着去表演的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 212, "start": "0:16:48.40", "end": "0:16:49.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说的也是啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 213, "start": "0:16:49.49", "end": "0:16:53.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是…看到那个时候的中西同学  我有种情不自禁的感觉"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 214, "start": "0:16:54.12", "end": "0:16:57.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是觉得这样一来剩下能够表演的成员不就太可怜了吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 215, "start": "0:16:57.94", "end": "0:17:00.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她们可是为了这一天拼命练习了很长时间啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 216, "start": "0:17:01.44", "end": "0:17:03.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以我就对她们说"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 217, "start": "0:17:03.94", "end": "0:17:06.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「这样的话要不要我来代替你上场」"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 218, "start": "0:17:06.36", "end": "0:17:09.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那些剩下来的成员竟然也真的同意了啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 219, "start": "0:17:09.47", "end": "0:17:11.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说「如果只是唱歌应该可以」"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 220, "start": "0:17:11.28", "end": "0:17:15.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后冈岛同学和财前同学都说「如果是你的话大概能做到」"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 221, "start": "0:17:15.53", "end": "0:17:18.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也曾经尝试加入过轻音乐社"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 222, "start": "0:17:18.49", "end": "0:17:19.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她们大概还记得吧？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 223, "start": "0:17:20.54", "end": "0:17:22.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然春日的奇人怪人传说很有名"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 224, "start": "0:17:23.23", "end": "0:17:26.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是作为一个什么都能做得一级棒的Super Utility Player"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 225, "start": "0:17:26.16", "end": "0:17:27.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在校内也是大名鼎鼎的啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 226, "start": "0:17:28.42", "end": "0:17:30.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其实如果能把吉他也练习一下就最好了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 227, "start": "0:17:31.06", "end": "0:17:32.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是实在没有时间"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 228, "start": "0:17:33.24", "end": "0:17:34.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不但必须伸手翻乐谱"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 229, "start": "0:17:35.08", "end": "0:17:37.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且光是记住按弦指法就伤透脑筋了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 230, "start": "0:17:37.54", "end": "0:17:38.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是就想到了长门吗"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 231, "start": "0:17:38.76", "end": "0:17:39.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 232, "start": "0:17:39.83", "end": "0:17:41.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在她正做占卜的时候冲了过去"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 233, "start": "0:17:41.74", "end": "0:17:44.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说明理由之后她马上就跟我们一起走了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 234, "start": "0:17:44.34", "end": "0:17:46.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道吗？有希意外地灵巧呢！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 235, "start": "0:17:47.13", "end": "0:17:50.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是随便扫了一眼谱子就弹得很完美了！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 236, "start": "0:17:50.72", "end": "0:17:53.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她是从多久以前就开始学吉他了啊？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 237, "start": "0:17:53.97", "end": "0:17:56.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概就是在你去找她的那一瞬间吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 238, "start": "0:17:56.84", "end": "0:17:58.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个  有客人来了哦"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 239, "start": "0:17:59.66", "end": "0:18:00.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是来找凉宫同学的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 240, "start": "0:18:08.04", "end": "0:18:08.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快去吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 241, "start": "0:18:13.61", "end": "0:18:14.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你跟我一起过去一下"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 242, "start": "0:18:17.60", "end": "0:18:19.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "扁桃腺发炎已经好了吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 243, "start": "0:18:19.33", "end": "0:18:20.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  基本上好了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 244, "start": "0:18:20.83", "end": "0:18:21.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "中西同学呢？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 245, "start": "0:18:22.14", "end": "0:18:23.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像要再花一阵子才能养好"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 246, "start": "0:18:23.63", "end": "0:18:25.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "备考复习就比较麻烦了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 247, "start": "0:18:26.01", "end": "0:18:27.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢你  凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 248, "start": "0:18:31.09", "end": "0:18:35.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很厉害呢  结束之后来索要原版音源的人一口气跑来了好多！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 249, "start": "0:18:35.35", "end": "0:18:37.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都赶不及一个个给MD录音了！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 250, "start": "0:18:37.96", "end": "0:18:39.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "数量多得令人吃惊呢！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 251, "start": "0:18:40.96", "end": "0:18:42.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这都是多亏了你呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 252, "start": "0:18:43.13", "end": "0:18:45.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样一来  我们自己写的歌就不会白白浪费掉了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 253, "start": "0:18:46.65", "end": "0:18:47.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的很感谢你"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 254, "start": "0:18:49.06", "end": "0:18:50.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真不愧是凉宫同学呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 255, "start": "0:18:50.94", "end": "0:18:51.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然这是作为轻音乐社成员"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 256, "start": "0:18:51.88", "end": "0:18:55.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次北高祭是我们最后的回忆  当然很想自己登台"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 257, "start": "0:18:55.58", "end": "0:18:57.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但这比弃权已经好了不知多少倍呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 258, "start": "0:18:58.66", "end": "0:18:59.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 259, "start": "0:18:59.88", "end": "0:19:02.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们想要给你一点谢礼…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 260, "start": "0:19:02.29", "end": "0:19:03.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  不用了不用了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 261, "start": "0:19:03.80", "end": "0:19:05.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也唱得很高兴"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 262, "start": "0:19:05.66", "end": "0:19:06.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "歌也很好听"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 263, "start": "0:19:06.91", "end": "0:19:09.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果给我谢礼的话反而会令我不安的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 264, "start": "0:19:09.69", "end": "0:19:11.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是你们去有希那里吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 265, "start": "0:19:11.60", "end": "0:19:13.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她可是我硬拉来的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 266, "start": "0:19:14.09", "end": "0:19:15.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才我们去过了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 267, "start": "0:19:15.53", "end": "0:19:18.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她点了点头之后就用手指着这间教室"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 268, "start": "0:19:19.52", "end": "0:19:20.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 269, "start": "0:19:20.50", "end": "0:19:23.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我们打算在毕业之前找个地方开一场演唱会"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 270, "start": "0:19:23.58", "end": "0:19:24.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果可以的话请来看看吧"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 271, "start": "0:19:25.00", "end": "0:19:25.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和你这位…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 272, "start": "0:19:26.99", "end": "0:19:28.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这位「朋友」一起来"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 273, "start": "0:19:29.33", "end": "0:19:32.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后春日一直是一脸复杂的表情"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 274, "start": "0:19:32.42", "end": "0:19:35.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚刚到午休的时间就立刻从教室中消失了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 275, "start": "0:19:36.32", "end": "0:19:39.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉呀  文化祭上还真是没有什么好女人"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 276, "start": "0:19:40.36", "end": "0:19:43.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "依照我的研究  是这所高中的地理条件太不利了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 277, "start": "0:19:43.78", "end": "0:19:45.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果不建在地势更平缓一些的地方是不会有人来的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 278, "start": "0:19:52.78", "end": "0:19:53.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "吃过饭之后"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 279, "start": "0:19:54.03", "end": "0:19:56.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我偶然想要去散散步消食"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 280, "start": "0:19:57.01", "end": "0:19:58.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  并没有什么特别的意义"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 281, "start": "0:20:06.58", "end": "0:20:07.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哟"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 282, "start": "0:20:17.23", "end": "0:20:18.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么事啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 283, "start": "0:20:27.12", "end": "0:20:30.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我没有足够的时间  只是做了一点简单的练习而已"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 284, "start": "0:20:30.85", "end": "0:20:33.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以人家当然会想要听原版的不是么"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 285, "start": "0:20:34.42", "end": "0:20:36.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你是说想要用MD录音的人的事吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 286, "start": "0:20:36.48", "end": "0:20:37.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 287, "start": "0:20:38.41", "end": "0:20:41.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  作为临阵磨枪的代演来说  你表演得很不错嘛"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 288, "start": "0:20:41.94", "end": "0:20:43.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不是也作了很好的宣传吗"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 289, "start": "0:20:45.04", "end": "0:20:48.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果还能再有一天的话  就可以好好地准备一番了呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 290, "start": "0:20:51.81", "end": "0:20:55.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然也想了一下「那样做究竟对不对」"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 291, "start": "0:20:56.30", "end": "0:20:57.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么说呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 292, "start": "0:20:58.62", "end": "0:21:02.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有种「我究竟在做些什么啊」的感觉…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 293, "start": "0:21:08.45", "end": "0:21:11.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉…不知怎么就是没办法静下心来"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 294, "start": "0:21:11.33", "end": "0:21:12.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么啊？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 295, "start": "0:21:12.76", "end": "0:21:14.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我怎么会知道"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 296, "start": "0:21:15.81", "end": "0:21:16.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 297, "start": "0:21:17.29", "end": "0:21:20.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是因为你不习惯被人感谢呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 298, "start": "0:21:21.40", "end": "0:21:24.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "平时你总是做些不可能被人道谢的事情啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 299, "start": "0:21:26.10", "end": "0:21:26.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…干什么啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 300, "start": "0:21:27.42", "end": "0:21:28.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么话想说吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 301, "start": "0:21:29.08", "end": "0:21:30.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "想说就说啊"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 302, "start": "0:21:30.59", "end": "0:21:32.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然反正也不会是什么好事"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 303, "start": "0:21:32.64", "end": "0:21:35.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是把嘴边的话吞到肚子里可是对身心有害的！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 304, "start": "0:21:36.21", "end": "0:21:37.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没什么想说的"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 305, "start": "0:21:41.87", "end": "0:21:42.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 306, "start": "0:21:48.06", "end": "0:21:50.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  你会什么乐器吗？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 307, "start": "0:21:50.17", "end": "0:21:50.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不会！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 308, "start": "0:21:50.95", "end": "0:21:52.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那只要去练就可以了"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 309, "start": "0:21:53.09", "end": "0:21:55.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说  我们还有一年时间呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 310, "start": "0:21:56.01", "end": "0:21:56.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂喂…"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 311, "start": "0:21:57.09", "end": "0:22:00.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明年文化祭我们也组织乐队参加吧！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 312, "start": "0:22:00.76", "end": "0:22:03.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是主唱  有希做吉他手"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 313, "start": "0:22:03.43", "end": "0:22:07.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠就让她拿个小手鼓之类美化一下舞台也挺好"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 314, "start": "0:22:08.13", "end": "0:22:09.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好不好不好"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 315, "start": "0:22:09.14", "end": "0:22:11.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然电影的第二作也要拍"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 316, "start": "0:22:11.41", "end": "0:22:13.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯！明年会很忙呢！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 317, "start": "0:22:13.97", "end": "0:22:18.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然目标点数要比前一年更高才像话嘛！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 318, "start": "0:22:18.35", "end": "0:22:18.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下等一下！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 319, "start": "0:22:19.14", "end": "0:22:20.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  走吧  阿虚"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 320, "start": "0:22:20.58", "end": "0:22:21.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？去哪里？"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 321, "start": "0:22:21.68", "end": "0:22:23.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去借器材啦！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 322, "start": "0:22:23.20", "end": "0:22:23.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 323, "start": "0:22:24.31", "end": "0:22:26.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去轻音乐社的社团教室"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 324, "start": "0:22:26.33", "end": "0:22:28.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去看看  说不定还有多余出来的呢"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 325, "start": "0:22:28.45", "end": "0:22:31.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有一定要去向中西同学问问作曲的窍门"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 326, "start": "0:22:31.45", "end": "0:22:34.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "放心吧  作词作曲和监制都由我来负责！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 327, "start": "0:22:34.91", "end": "0:22:36.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然舞蹈编排也是！"}
{"ep": "26", "idx": 328, "start": "0:22:36.30", "end": "0:22:37.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不需要从现在就开始准备吧！"}
